# Only what lands in the ctbrowser PROJECT ROOT, which is where ctest now runs
# every test from: `add_test(... WORKING_DIRECTORY "${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}")`,
# and PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR became this directory when the repository became a
# monorepo. A stray screenshot, profile or log from a hand-run test lands here.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash, like the repository root's file and for the
# same reason: test/, unittests/, benchmarks/ and examples/ carry their
# own rules, and a bare pattern here would reach into all of them.
/*.ppm
/*.log
/*.csv
